# Spotter UI kit

Before adding or redesigning UI in `src/pages` / `src/components`, follow the living kit at
`/app/admin/ui` (`src/pages/UiKitPage.tsx`) and tokens in `src/styles/color-themes.css`,
`src/styles/global.css`, and `src/styles/sheets.css`.

## Must follow

1. **One primary action per section.** Default `.btn` is 48px. Secondary block actions use
   `.btn-sm` (40px) and/or `.btn-soft` / `.btn-ghost`. Do not stack many full-size ghost blocks.
2. **Secondary screens:** `SubpageHeader` — one row, left-aligned `[.subpage-back] [.page-title]
   [optional action]`. Title is the *current* screen, never the previous one. Do not center the
   title and do not duplicate it in the content. Root tabs (Мой зал / Залы / Чаты / Профиль) have
   no back. Chat and another user’s profile reuse `SubpageBack` without a page-title row.
   Workouts IA: list is the hub (`goWorkoutsHub` / replace). Hub exits to Home (`exitWorkoutsSection`
   / replace). Never `navigate(-1)` from the list and never push `/app/workouts`
   on top of progress or a session.
3. **Section headings:** only `SectionTitle` / `.section-title` — no one-off `h2` font sizes for
   the same role. Section titles are Onest 600 (`--text-section-size` 1.05rem / lh 1.25), not
   Unbounded. Page titles are Unbounded (`--text-page-size` 1.4375rem / 700). Full specimen lives
   on the UI kit «Типографика» block. Kickers and labels are sentence case — no `uppercase` and no
   letter-spacing 0.04–0.10em.
4. **SectionTitle actions:** use `.section-action` for Link and `<button>` (“Кого я лайкнул”,
   “Добавить”, “Изменить”). Same Onest muted 500 look — no `.text-link` / font-weight 650 in the
   action slot. Non-click meta → `.muted` / `.dim`. Admin accent nav links may keep `.text-link`
   outside SectionTitle.
5. **Section entry links:** use `.entry-tools` + `.entry-link` for frequent product tools outside
   bottom-nav (Home: workouts, activity). Support feedback → Settings “Поддержка” as
   `btn btn-ghost btn-block` (not entry-link). Admin → Profile bottom `btn-ghost` (admins only).
   Contextual help (request gym) → soft/ghost `btn-sm` next to the empty task.
6. **Feedback:** `MomentFX` only for check-in / check-out / rare celebration. Routine success
   (like, copy, share) → `SoftFlash`.
7. **Bottom sheets:** compose `.app-sheet`, `.app-sheet-backdrop`, `.app-sheet-panel`,
   `.app-sheet-grab` + `useSheetA11y`. Do not invent another backdrop/panel copy-paste.
8. **Empty states:** `.empty-copy` + `.empty-copy-title` + `.empty-copy-lead` + one primary CTA;
   extra CTA → `btn-sm`. Never show empty while the region is still loading.
9. **Loaders:** before adding a spinner anywhere, follow the UI kit «Лоадер» block. Use only
   `SoftLoader` in the content slot that will be filled (min-height ~120px). Keep header, tabs,
   and the primary CTA mounted and still. Delay the ring 280–400ms unless the parent already
   waited (`useGymPeople` 1s → `delayMs={0}`). Use `SOFT_LOADER_DELAY_MS` (320). One loader per
   region. Button busy = label («Сохраняем…»), not a second spinner. Do not invent CSS rings or
   skeletons.
10. **List rows with multiple actions:** primary navigation on the left; secondary (copy/expand)
   as separate targets — see workout history pattern on UiKit page.
11. **Profile edit:** Settings via header gear; do not add a second full-width “Редактировать
    профиль” CTA wall. Feedback lives in Settings; admin contour button only for `isAdmin`.
    Log out is a routine `btn btn-ghost btn-block` at the bottom of Settings (same weight as
    Profile admin). Delete account is a quiet text control under it — never a 48px CTA or
    danger card. Confirm step may use `btn-danger btn-sm`. Do not invert those weights.
12. **Segmented control:** exclusive view switch (2–4 options) uses `.seg` + `.seg-item` +
    `.is-active`. Page-level tabs (Likes, Notifications, Progress period, Activity period) use
    `.seg--fill`: full width, equal columns, text centered. Compact hug-text (`.seg--fit`) is
    only when the control sits beside something else in a toolbar. Items ~32px
    (`padding: 6px 12px`). Button or `Link` as `.seg-item`. Onest 500, active 600. Do not invent
    a local tab recipe. Not chips (multi-filter / labels) and not `.toggle` / `.toggle-row`
    (on/off). Specimen: UI kit «Сегмент».
13. **Lists after flatten:** People / gyms = `UserCard` / `GymCard` in `.card-list.card-list--cards`
    (`gap: 12px`). Likes = divider rows (`.liked-list` / `.liked-row`). Workouts history = one
    grouped `.workouts-list`. Chats = conversation rows, not a card per chat. Notifications
    feed = `.card-list` with explicit `gap: 10px` (global `.card-list` is `gap: 0`). Profile
    sections = `.profile-block` (hairline), not stacked `.surface`. Do not wrap each row in
    `.surface`.

## Typography

Fonts load once in `src/main.tsx` via `@fontsource`. Do not import fonts in components.

| Token | Face | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--font-brand` | Syne | SPOTTER wordmark only (SPOT + lime TER) |
| `--font-display` | Unbounded | Page titles, gym heroes, profile names |
| `--font-body` | Onest | All UI: body, buttons, nav, chips, forms, stats, sections |

Stacks:

- `--font-display: 'Unbounded', 'Onest', sans-serif`
- `--font-brand: 'Syne', 'Unbounded', sans-serif`
- `--font-body: 'Onest', sans-serif`

Do not use Manrope, Montserrat, Roboto, Inter, Arial, or `system-ui` as the product UI face.
Do not add a fourth family. Do not write `font-family: Onest` locally — use the token.

### Roles

- **Syne:** `.brand-mark` / lock / emergency / landing wordmark. Never body, buttons, cards, nav.
- **Unbounded:** `.page-title` (1.4375rem / 700 / lh 1.15 / `--letter-tight`), `.home-gym-title`
  and `.gym-hero-title` (700), profile names (`.profile-hero-name`, `.profile-hero-cover-copy h1`)
  at **800**, and hall `UserCard` name / age / rank (`.user-card-head h3`, 700). Not body, lists
  of copy, buttons, tab bar, small labels, section titles, metrics.
- **Onest:** everything else. 400 body / muted / dim / chips. 500 nav, selected chips, section-action.
  600 buttons, section titles, metrics, strong UI. Do **not** load or use Onest 700+.

Hierarchy = size + weight + line-height + color + spacing. Do not fake emphasis with 650/750/800
on Onest. Fake weights 550/650/750 are forbidden.

### Tokens

- `--text-page-weight: 700`
- `--text-section-weight: 600` (Onest, letter-spacing normal)
- `--text-label-weight: 600`
- `--text-ui-emphasis: 500`
- `--text-ui-strong: 600`
- `--text-chip: 400`
- `--text-chip-active: 500`
- `--text-body-line: 1.45`
- `--letter-tight: -0.03em` — Unbounded only

Line-heights: display 1.0–1.15, UI headings 1.15–1.25, body 1.4–1.55, small UI 1.2–1.4,
buttons ~1.0–1.2. Reuse existing tokens; do not invent a second type scale.

Cyrillic is the primary target. Do not apply aggressive tracking to Russian. Do not hide overflow
on long labels («Открыт к знакомству», «Записать тренировку»).

## Color

Tokens live in `src/styles/color-themes.css`. Default `:root` is the current production palette.
Do not invent a parallel `--color-*` system. Screens use `var(--*)` from `global.css`.

| Role | Token | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Brand | `--accent` / `--accent-ink` / `--accent-soft` | Primary CTA, selected chips, active tab, SPOTTER TER, coach, PR, «Я в зале» |
| Presence | `--online` / `--online-soft` | Dots and «В зале». Text is `--text`; do not stack mint text + fill + border |
| Progress | `--progress` | Workout line charts and activity bars. Aliases `--accent` (lime) in both palettes |
| Unread | `--text` on `--bg-soft` / `--line-strong` | Nav and chat badges, notification unread. Not lime |
| Danger / warning | `--danger` / `--warning` (+ `-soft`) | Expire, validation, destructive only |

Admin preview: `.toggle-row` on Admin hub («Новая палитра»). Sets `html[data-spotter-theme=v2]`
and `localStorage` key `spotter.color-theme`. Apply only after `user.isAdmin` is known
(`src/lib/colorTheme.ts`). Ordinary sessions always stay on the current palette. Not chips and
not `.seg`.

